From: hdosys <71881005+hdosys@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:41:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/11] fix(opencode): preserve truthful lifecycle state

Defer root-session errors until idle or a bounded fallback, cancel them when explicit continuing status follows, and prevent terminal blocked state from being overwritten by legacy idle events. Keep outstanding root and child prompts blocked until their exact replies arrive so unrelated busy or idle events cannot erase user-waiting state.
